## Pepto Production monitoring parameters

### dataos-core-prod account (828361281741):

- **URL:** [https://awsconsole.hpicloud.net/](https://awsconsole.hpicloud.net/)
- **Load Balancer Name:** k8s-peptoprod-b6aa4e3c88
- **Role:** facade-prod-admin-role
- **Load Balancer:**
  - Check Total Request Count
  - P99 Statistics - Target Response Time
  - 4xx
  - TargetConnectionErrorCount
  - TargetTLSNegotiationErrors
- **Cloudwatch:**
  - All Alarms: Critical, 5xx, waf
- **ElastiCache:**
  - k8s-pds-even-redis-production
  - k8s-pds-odd-redis-production
  - CPU, Memory, Item Count

### Health check of pods - K8S Dashboard

- **URL:** [https://tools-apps.hpdataos.com/tools/dashboard/#/pod?namespace=pds-prod](https://tools-apps.hpdataos.com/tools/dashboard/#/pod?namespace=pds-prod)
- **Namespaces:** pds-prod, facade-prod, facade-pie, facade-stg
- For facade-prod, the count of pods should not be greater than 15.
- For pds-prod, the count of pods should not be greater than 20.

### CPU and Memory usage of pods - Grafana Dashboard

- **URL:** [https://tools-apps.hpdataos.com/tools/grafana/d/85a562078cdf77779eaa1add43ccec1e/kubernetes-compute-resources-namespace-pods?orgId=1&refresh=10s&var-datasource=default&var-cluster=&var-namespace=pds-prod](https://tools-apps.hpdataos.com/tools/grafana/d/85a562078cdf77779eaa1add43ccec1e/kubernetes-compute-resources-namespace-pods?orgId=1&refresh=10s&var-datasource=default&var-cluster=&var-namespace=pds-prod)
- **Namespaces:** pds-prod, facade-prod, facade-pie, facade-stg

